---
import { fhcEmail, principals } from '../site.config';

const [john] = principals;
---
<section id="request" class="request" aria-labelledby="request-title">
  <div class="container section-pad">
    <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p>
    <h2 id="request-title" class="h2">It starts with one email.</h2>
    <p class="lede">The Foundation for Healthy Communities runs a program that pays for outside help for organizations getting Rural Health Transformation money. We're one of their approved consultants, so you can ask for us by name.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <p class="num" aria-hidden="true">1</p>
        <h3 class="item-title">Email the Foundation</h3>
        <p class="item-text">Send a note to <a href={`mailto:${fhcEmail}`}>{fhcEmail}</a>. Tell them what's going on and that you'd like to work with Granite North Advisors.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="num" aria-hidden="true">2</p>
        <h3 class="item-title">We'll give you a call</h3>
        <p class="item-text">We'll figure out what's bugging you most, decide what to fix first, and take care of the paperwork.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p class="num" aria-hidden="true">3</p>
        <h3 class="item-title">We get to work</h3>
        <p class="item-text">Once the Foundation signs off, we start. The program pays us. You won't get a bill.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qualify">We work with rural health clinics, FQHCs, community health centers, independent practices and critical access hospitals. Not sure you qualify? <a href={`mailto:${john.email}`}>Email us</a> and we'll find out for you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .request {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .h2 {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .lede {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(260px, 100%), 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  li {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .num {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 40px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .item-text a { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  .qualify {
    margin: 40px 0 0;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
